@unit UNIT III · EXTERNAL SECTOR

@chapter 17 | India's Foreign Trade

@intro
The external sector opens with **India's foreign trade**: its size and share in world trade, **trading partners** (countries and regions), the **composition of imports and exports**, leading export items, states and markets, and the basics of the **balance of trade and balance of payments**. Trade data change every year, so many old keys have moved; each such case is noted. It contains **{pyqs} PYQs and {ones} one-liners**.
