@up UP link: UP's main exports are **electronics (Noida)**, carpets (Bhadohi), leather (Kanpur, Agra), brassware (Moradabad) and processed foods. Noida's mobile-phone factories made UP a major smartphone exporter.

@trap
**India: about 1.8% of world goods exports, 4.3% of services.** **China leads world trade now (USA earlier).** **Asia = largest trade region.** **USA = top export market and surplus; China = top import source and deficit.** **Balance of trade = goods only; BoP = all transactions.** **CAD = imports exceed.** **Crude oil = top import; Qatar = LNG.** **Import starts with indent; importer gets the L/C.** **Engineering goods = top export; Gujarat = top state.** **Kenya = top tea exporter; India = top rice exporter.**
@end

