@pattern
Trade figures were asked heavily in 2002-2017 and keep going out of date. The **2016-2024** papers moved to concepts (trade-GDP ratio, BoP, CAD) and current leaders (top export item, top partner). Learn the **latest Economic Survey** tables.
@end

